  "definition": "Waiver Request",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-12-22",
  "historyNote": "#7901, eff 5-29-03 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1900) (formerly Env-Ws 1907.02); ss by #9936, eff 5-28-11; ss by #12695, eff 12-22-18 (from Env-Wq 1908.01)",
